# Keep the Docker build context small and avoid copying host build artifacts
# into images. The cadre-cli image builds from the repo root as its context
# (see packages/cadre-cli/docker/docker-compose.yml) and COPYs only package
# manifests, src/, and tsconfig files — never host node_modules or dist — so
# excluding the following is safe and keeps the context lean.
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/*.tsbuildinfo
.yarn/cache
.yarn/install-state.gz
.git
